            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Gà Má Hải - Hội An Quán",
            "review_text": "axk\nSingapore, Singapore1053 contributions\n0\nGood lunch and massage\nDec 2024 • Friends\nEric from Good Morning Travel brought us to Com Que Ma Hai for a wonderful lunch. We love the steam rice in little claypot and the dishes pre ordered by Eric.\n\nIn the evening we visited Gaochi Legend Spa & Wellness. We were picked by the CEO herself at no charge and back to our hotel. It was a pleasant set-up, clean and professional personnel. We also pre-ordered meals after our massages. Their prices for the wellness were reasonable.\n\nThe personnel could speak English and that makes us very comfortable.\n\nWe enjoy our days in DALAT.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nEnjoy the hot steamed rice and delicious dishes\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 6, 2025",
